values so you

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:41.640
don't waste as much time
trying out combinations

00:01:41.640 --> 00:01:44.490
that yield low-accuracy scores.

00:01:44.490 --> 00:01:47.460
But training a model
once takes long enough,

00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:51.000
so having to run multiple trials
of your training code, each

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:54.760
with different values, can
be very time-consuming.

00:01:54.760 --> 00:01:58.600
