We saw how to use Vertex AI
for hyperparameter tuning

00:31:44.390 --> 00:31:46.190
and distributed training.

00:31:46.190 --> 00:31:50.540
We used a Vertex AI managed
workbench instance as well as

00:31:50.540 --> 00:31:55.160
the Vertex AI Python SDK to
help us to launch and configure

00:31:55.160 --> 00:31:57.680
this hyperparameter tuning job.

00:31:57.680 --> 00:31:59.720
I hope this gives
